#! /bin/sh
# Early exit and termination while worker threads are busy: -q, -m1,
# -l and -L with the deciding match at the start, in the middle, at the
# end, or nowhere; readers that go away (SIGPIPE, and EPIPE with SIGPIPE
# ignored); a full output device; termination by a signal; and running
# out of file descriptors.  Each run must finish (no hang), report the
# right exit status, and print each diagnostic exactly once.
#
